Package: bscm
Title: Bayesian Synthetic Control Models
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jouni", "Helske", email = "jouni.helske@iki.fi", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7130-793X"))
Description: Bayesian treatment of synthetic control method with posterior 
    uncertainty estimates of treatment effects and other quantities of 
    interest, as well as various model evaluation and comparison 
    methods. Models support time-varying covariates with possibly 
    time-varying effects. Single and multiple treated units with staggered 
    treatment times are supported. Posterior sampling uses Markov chain 
    Monte Carlo via Stan. 
